 "description": "​Most people see a house; I see a complex system of structural integrity, mechanical components, and potential liabilities. As a licensed professional based in Gilbert, Arizona, and the founder of Property Inspections Plus, my goal is to strip away the \"curb appeal\" and show you what you’re actually buying.\n\n​What you’ll find here:\n​The \"Why\" Behind the Defect: I don’t just point at a crack; I explain the soil expansion or structural load causing it.\n\n​High-Tech Deep Dives: From thermal imaging and moisture mapping to sewer scopes, I use the latest tech to see what the naked eye misses.\n\n​Real Talk for Homeowners: Maintenance tips, \"contractor collective\" insights, and the occasional vintage restoration project (because I appreciate how things were meant to be built).\n\n​Industry Transparency: Whether you’re a first-time buyer, a seasoned investor, or a fellow inspector, I’m here to raise the bar for what a home inspection should be.",
